NAME
    gcloud alpha memorystore instances token-auth-users auth-tokens - manage
        Auth Token resources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud alpha memorystore instances token-auth-users auth-tokens COMMAND
        [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (ALPHA) Manage Auth Token resources.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     delete
        (ALPHA) Delete authTokens.

     describe
        (ALPHA) Describe authTokens.

     list
        (ALPHA) List authTokens.

NOTES
    This command is currently in alpha and might change without notice. If this
    command fails with API permission errors despite specifying the correct
    project, you might be trying to access an API with an invitation-only early
    access allowlist. This variant is also available:

        $ gcloud beta memorystore instances token-auth-users auth-tokens

